      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a 6-year-old, focus on the idea that people are a \"big, wonderful mix of how they feel inside and how the world sees them outside of their body.\" You can explain that some people feel like a certain gender on the inside, and that might be different from the gender they were given at birth, like using a \"right fit for their heart and head\" way of being. The important part is to emphasize love and respect for *all* people, no matter how they feel or how they choose to be seen.",
